{"name":"Polliwog","hex":"#e2cf24","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"polliwog","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of pollywog."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/polliwog"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tadpole","blocks":[{"text":"A tadpole or polliwog is the larval stage in the biological life cycle of an amphibian. Most tadpoles are fully aquatic, though some species of amphibians have tadpoles that are terrestrial. Tadpoles have some fish-like features that may not be found in adult amphibians, such as a lateral line, gills and swimming tails. As they undergo metamorphosis, they start to develop functional lungs for breathing air, and the diet of tadpoles changes drastically."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/RanaTemporariaLarva2.jpg/330px-RanaTemporariaLarva2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tadpole","wikidata":"Q168525"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Tadpoles_10_days.jpg/500px-Tadpoles_10_days.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Tadpoles_10_days.jpg/500px-Tadpoles_10_days.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Ten-day-old tadpoles. The external gills will eventually be hidden by a layer of skin.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATadpoles_10_days.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Bufo_metamorphosis.jpg/330px-Bufo_metamorphosis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/04/Bufo_metamorphosis.jpg/330px-Bufo_metamorphosis.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Metamorphosis of Bufo bufo","link":"https://en.wikipedia.